# Urban Grocers – API Testing

## Project Overview

This project focused on validating API functionality related to kits and delivery services within the Urban Grocers platform.

## Testing Activities

- Requirements analysis
- Test case design
- API request execution
- Response validation
- Defect identification
- Bug reporting

## Features Tested

- Kit management
- Delivery services

## Tools

- Postman
- API Documentation
- Jira

## Results

API endpoints were validated through manual testing, and defects were documented and reported when requirements were not met.
